# Product

AgentDashboard is a personal multi-agent orchestration system with a live visual control panel.
It lets one orchestrator agent decompose a goal into subtasks, dispatch them to persistent
"worker" agents (coding agent, PM, outreach, research specialist, etc.), and spawn short-lived
subagents per subtask. The dashboard shows workers as persistent nodes; clicking a worker
assigns it a task and shows subagents spawning/completing in real time.

Primary goal: reliable, unattended execution of well-scoped tasks with minimal live oversight,
gated by eval-tested prompts, not "vibes." This is a tool for the owner's own project work, not
a product for other users. Optimize for correctness and debuggability over polish.
